# Cloudflare reads this file (Workers Static Assets and Pages both support
# it) and applies the listed headers to every response matching the path.
#
# HSTS: tells browsers to only ever reach this origin over HTTPS, for the
# next year, on this domain and all subdomains, and to consider it eligible
# for browser HSTS-preload lists. Cloudflare already terminates TLS and
# redirects HTTP -> HTTPS at the edge, but that first request is still
# vulnerable to a downgrade attack; this header removes that window entirely
# for any browser that has visited before (or ships with the preload list).
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains; preload
